province = 55
blurb = "Mariko, a tea house and rest stop on the Tōkaidō, the Eastern Sea Road connecting Kyōto and Edo (present-day Tōkyō).

The white vertical sign in front of the teahouse advertises the house's meibutsu, or specialty: tororo-jiru, a soup made from grated mountain potatoes. Mariko's specialty was immortalized in a haiku by Matsuo Bashō, Japan's greatest poet, and was well known throughout the Edo period."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
